id: pm-review-sdk-gap
title: Follow up SDK schemaAddField type forwarding
description: "Originally recorded as: the pinned SDK helper drops the type option. Re-investigated on the current pin (pm-review#16): the pinned schemaAddField helper forwards the declared field type, so no upstream correction is needed. pm-review keeps the public schema action path and its real SDK numeric/boolean round-trip regressions."
